<title>YUGOSLAVIA: BASKETBALL-INTERNATIONAL TOURNAMENT RESULT.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-INTERNATIONAL TOURNAMENT RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in an international</p>
<p>basketball tournament on Friday:</p>
<p>Red Star (Yugoslavia) beat Dinamo (Russia) 92-90 (halftime</p>
<p>47-47)</p>
